WEBVTT

00:00.957 --> 00:02.607
<i></i>Exgate Online<i>.</i>

00:02.997 --> 00:06.057
<i>It was an online, orthodox fantasy 
game about swords and magic,</i>

00:06.057 --> 00:07.617
<i>set in the parallel world of Mizgarz.</i>

00:08.417 --> 00:11.027
<i>I had once aimed to be
a top player in the game,</i>

00:10.577 --> 00:11.497
<b>I shall bestow a new role upon you</b>

00:10.577 --> 00:11.497
Will you accept?

00:11.027 --> 00:14.377
<i>but one day, I came to Mizgarz, 
possessing the avatar I used in-game:</i>

00:14.377 --> 00:16.547
<i>Lufas Maphaahl!</i>

00:16.547 --> 00:20.127
<i>This was the world two hundred years
after the world I knew,</i>

00:20.127 --> 00:21.757
<b>The Sky Tower of Maphaahl</b>

00:20.387 --> 00:24.177
<i>and here in Maphaahl Tower, my old 
base, I met my advisor, Dina.</i>

00:25.307 --> 00:28.387
<i>There, I decided on two goals for myself.</i>

00:28.387 --> 00:31.147
<i>My first would be retrieving the 
Conquering Twelve Heavenly Stars who</i>

00:31.147 --> 00:32.477
<i>served under me.</i>

00:31.147 --> 00:32.477
<b>Conquering Twelve
Heavenly Stars</b>

00:32.477 --> 00:35.137
<i>At present, I've managed to retrieve</i>

00:35.137 --> 00:37.027
<i>Aries the Ram,</i>

00:37.037 --> 00:38.897
<i>Libra of the Scales,</i>

00:38.897 --> 00:40.607
<i>Aigokeros the Goat,</i>

00:40.607 --> 00:42.407
<i>and... since Parthenos the Maiden</i>

00:42.407 --> 00:44.827
<i>is dead and now exists as a ghost,</i>

00:44.827 --> 00:46.487
<i>we have only those three.</i>

00:47.277 --> 00:50.617
<i>My second goal is meeting 
the Seven Heroes.</i>

00:51.127 --> 00:53.707
<i>In the game, they were 
top-ranked players, like me.</i>

