<i>and I want to confirm my suspicions.</i>

01:00.087 --> 01:03.677
<i>However, of the three still alive 
in this world, two of them—</i>

01:03.677 --> 01:06.417
<i>Megrez and Merak—proved 
not to be players.</i>

01:07.197 --> 01:11.337
<i>That only leaves one of the 
Seven Heroes: Benetnasch.</i>

01:11.697 --> 01:15.477
<i>In the midst of that, I set out
to rescue the summoned Hero,</i>

01:15.477 --> 01:18.977
<i>where I encountered the game's official 
final boss: the Devil King, Orm.</i>

01:19.527 --> 01:22.107
<i>There I learned a shocking truth.</i>

01:22.607 --> 01:24.967
<i>This entire world is following 
the goddess's scenario,</i>

01:24.967 --> 01:27.807
<i>and progressing as she intends it to.</i>

01:28.497 --> 01:31.657
<i>That was how I gained the 
ultimate goal for my journey.</i>

01:32.027 --> 01:34.957
<i>To uncover the true intentions 
of this world's Lufas,</i>

01:34.957 --> 01:36.977
<i>rip a hole in the goddess's scenario,</i>

01:36.977 --> 01:38.207
<i>drag that goddess out,</i>

01:38.207 --> 01:40.087
<i>and find out what she's truly after.</i>

01:40.577 --> 01:45.677
<i>Yes, this is my counterattack on 
the goddess who dragged me into this!</i>

01:52.227 --> 01:53.747
Lady Lufas?

01:53.747 --> 01:55.607
Umm, your face...

01:55.607 --> 01:57.127
Hmm? My face?

01:57.127 --> 01:57.977
Yes.

01:57.977 --> 02:02.477
Lately, you've looked much more 
peaceful than in the past,

02:02.477 --> 02:03.817
but just now...

02:03.817 --> 02:06.507
your expression was more
like the old you.

02:08.357 --> 02:09.377
I see.

02:10.597 --> 02:13.997
<i>I'm here to serve as a lid on 
the real Lufas's consciousness.</i>

02:13.997 --> 02:16.757
<i>However, that lid is 
already starting to open.</i>

02:17.067 --> 02:19.097
<i>Especially if it's starting 
to show on my face.</i>

02:19.457 --> 02:20.977
<i>If things continue like this,</i>

02:20.977 --> 02:25.417
<i>perhaps "my" consciousness will fade 
and become incorporated into "Lufas's."</i>

02:26.147 --> 02:30.147
<i>Still, there's no other way to 
uncover a lead on the goddess's plan.</i>

02:34.737 --> 02:37.177
<i>What kind of shitty game is this?</i>

