<b>Episode 13</b>

02:41.527 --> 02:43.987
I truly wish I could
accompany you, however...

02:43.987 --> 02:44.737
No matter.

02:44.737 --> 02:45.647
Worry not.

02:46.027 --> 02:47.687
Still, you can rest assured.

02:47.687 --> 02:50.527
Let me send Virgo with you in my stead.

02:50.527 --> 02:51.847
Huh?!

02:52.277 --> 02:53.807
She's still inexperienced,

02:53.807 --> 02:56.587
but I've taught her the basics 
that she needs to know.

02:56.587 --> 02:57.897
I'm sure—

02:56.587 --> 02:58.337
Umm, Granny?

02:58.337 --> 02:59.367
My grandchild,

02:59.367 --> 03:03.277
I won't allow you to remain
in this forest forever.

03:03.277 --> 03:03.537
Huh?!

03:03.537 --> 03:05.807
Go on and go see the world.

03:05.807 --> 03:07.377
It'll be...

03:07.637 --> 03:08.507
good for you!

03:08.507 --> 03:09.847
Wha?!

03:10.547 --> 03:14.267
Lady Lufas, I'm sure this girl 
will prove useful to you!

03:14.267 --> 03:15.157
Huh?

03:15.157 --> 03:19.607
<i>I suppose I will need a new "Maiden" 
now that Parthenos is dead.</i>

03:19.607 --> 03:21.417
What do you want, Virgo?

03:23.187 --> 03:24.517
If I stay in this forest,

03:24.517 --> 03:27.527
Granny's just going to 
drive me out anyway...

03:29.037 --> 03:29.987
So!

03:31.067 --> 03:34.447
I-I look forward to our time together!

03:40.717 --> 03:42.207
<b>Virgo Has Joined Your Party</b>

03:43.077 --> 03:44.807
Granny!

03:44.807 --> 03:46.677
Farewell!

03:46.677 --> 03:49.747
Take care of Lady Lufas!

03:57.917 --> 04:00.897
Now the Twelve Heavenly Stars 
are back up to four.

04:00.897 --> 04:04.087
Yes. We need to find the others soon too.

04:04.087 --> 04:07.717
Scorpius the Scorpion has been 
working with the devilfolk,

04:07.717 --> 04:09.857
so why don't we head to her next?

04:10.597 --> 04:13.227
She's also the one who wiped out Hrotti,

04:13.227 --> 04:16.827
the nation founded by the Adventuring 
King, Phecda, one of the Seven Heroes.

04:16.827 --> 04:17.737
Hmm...

04:18.327 --> 04:21.307
<i>Hey, she's the one who's messed 
things up the most so far!</i>

04:21.667 --> 04:24.257
Yeah, Scorpius, huh?

04:24.257 --> 04:27.797
She really adored Lady Lufas.

04:27.797 --> 04:32.387
If her adoration turned directly 
into hatred towards humanity,

04:32.657 --> 04:35.847
then I believe she will prove 
an extremely dangerous person.

04:35.847 --> 04:38.807
<i>Is the Scorpion </i>that<i> crazy a woman?!</i>

04:38.807 --> 04:44.237
Right now, she's a demon of vengeance 
who wouldn't even listen to me!

04:44.237 --> 04:48.237
Her hatred is so strong that it's pushed 
her past her limit into Level 900,

04:48.237 --> 04:50.277
so even I couldn't handle her.

04:50.627 --> 04:51.937
<i>Unlike the golems,</i>

04:51.937 --> 04:55.007
<i>the monsters serving under 
me were capped at Level 800,</i>

04:55.007 --> 04:57.237
<i>so what is she doing exceeding 
that cap on her own?!</i>

04:57.727 --> 05:01.457
Aigokeros, do you know which 
nation Scorpius will target next?

05:01.457 --> 05:02.327
Yes.

05:02.327 --> 05:06.047
She said she would destroy Blutgang.

05:06.047 --> 05:08.257
Blutgang?

05:09.057 --> 05:12.187
That's a dwarven nation with 
flourishing industries,

05:12.187 --> 05:15.137
founded by the Blacksmith King, 
Mizar, one of the Seven Heroes.

05:15.137 --> 05:17.597
Judging from what Sir Aigokeros has said,

05:17.597 --> 05:20.567
Lady Scorpius is targeting 
nations whose hero is absent.

05:20.567 --> 05:24.497
That suggests she's working up from 
the most easily conquered nations.

05:24.497 --> 05:25.507
I see.

05:25.507 --> 05:27.057
If I may...

05:27.347 --> 05:29.387
I have one more special 
bit of information too!

05:29.387 --> 05:30.227
What's that?

05:30.227 --> 05:31.147
As chance would have it,

05:31.147 --> 05:32.667
there's already one there!

05:32.667 --> 05:36.827
Sir Karkinos the Crab, one of the 
Twelve Heavenly Stars, is in Blutgang!

05:38.227 --> 05:39.627
<i>I can't believe we'll retrieve both the</i>

05:39.627 --> 05:41.287
<i>Crab and the Scorpion at the same time!</i>

05:42.237 --> 05:43.867
That makes matters simple.

05:43.867 --> 05:46.337
We shall head to Blutgang!

05:47.077 --> 05:48.687
We're going to stop Scorpius!

05:48.687 --> 05:50.007
Yes!

05:48.687 --> 05:50.007
Affirmative.

05:48.687 --> 05:50.007
Y-Yes!

05:52.817 --> 05:57.427
<b>Outskirts of Blutgang</b>

06:01.907 --> 06:05.187
<i>Please watch, my beloved Lady Lufas!</i>

06:05.717 --> 06:12.387
<i>Your Scorpius shall stain the 
world in despair for your sake!</i>

06:15.917 --> 06:18.157
Oh, it's coming into view!

06:15.917 --> 06:18.157
<b>Several Days Later...</b>

06:19.927 --> 06:21.117
Huh? Huh?

06:26.077 --> 06:29.907
This is the mobile capital, Blutgang!

06:28.767 --> 06:32.127
<b>Mobile Capital Blutgang</b>

06:32.527 --> 06:35.127
Mobile... capital?

06:35.597 --> 06:40.577
Blutgang was the last and greatest 
work of the Blacksmith King, Mizar.

06:40.577 --> 06:45.317
It's Level 770 and extraordinarily 
tough against physical attacks,

06:45.317 --> 06:48.477
allowing it to repel all of 
the devilfolk's invasions.

06:48.927 --> 06:52.817
<i>Come on, Mizar,
did you forget what genre this is?</i>

06:52.817 --> 06:56.627
<i>What are you doing building a colossal 
battleship in a fantasy world?!</i>

06:59.777 --> 07:00.987
Oh?

07:01.617 --> 07:03.007
What's going on here?!

07:03.007 --> 07:05.107
There's a sky inside this thing?

07:05.107 --> 07:06.597
It's neat, isn't it?

07:06.997 --> 07:09.047
Uhh, we're currently—

07:09.047 --> 07:11.627
We are presently located 
in the first district.

07:11.627 --> 07:15.107
There are fifteen floors in 
total within Blutgang,

07:15.107 --> 07:17.507
and eight of those floors 
are residential areas,

07:17.507 --> 07:19.207
while the floors above them contain

07:19.207 --> 07:21.717
commercial and industrial facilities 
and the king's governing area.

07:21.717 --> 07:23.517
The residents number around 100,000,

07:23.837 --> 07:27.387
and the uppermost floor is 
centered around the control room.

07:27.387 --> 07:30.357
M-My chance to explain...

07:30.357 --> 07:32.357
You're especially familiar with it, Libra.

07:32.357 --> 07:34.977
Blutgang is essentially...

07:35.357 --> 07:37.427
my little brother.

07:37.427 --> 07:39.337
<i>Hey, that's one huge little brother!</i>

07:39.917 --> 07:42.867
<i>Well, Libra was made by Mizar too,</i>

07:43.697 --> 07:46.277
<i>so I'm sure she has some 
feelings toward this.</i>

07:47.287 --> 07:48.657
One more thing!

07:48.657 --> 07:51.117
It can transform into a humanoid 
form during emergencies,

07:51.117 --> 07:52.957
so it can punch back too!

07:53.607 --> 07:55.707
<i>Anything goes at this point, huh?</i>

07:56.207 --> 07:59.177
However, when up against Lady Scorpius...

08:01.237 --> 08:02.347
<i>That's true.</i>

08:03.327 --> 08:05.927
<i>It's a terrible match.</i>

08:06.837 --> 08:09.807
<i>Scropius the Scorpion 
is a poison specialist.</i>

08:09.807 --> 08:13.007
<i>While Blutgang might be 
immune to poison as a golem,</i>

08:13.007 --> 08:16.147
<i>if all the residents inside 
of it are wiped out by poison,</i>

08:16.147 --> 08:19.107
<i>then that essentially spells its defeat.</i>

08:19.787 --> 08:21.937
So, where is Karkinos?

08:21.937 --> 08:23.447
I don't know his exact location.

08:23.447 --> 08:24.857
Please leave that to me.

08:24.857 --> 08:26.667
If you'll just wait a moment,

08:26.667 --> 08:28.507
I can analyze every
resident's breathing

08:28.507 --> 08:30.847
and cross-reference against 
my memory to locate him.

08:32.497 --> 08:34.017
Lady Lufas...

08:34.017 --> 08:34.547
Hmm?

08:34.547 --> 08:37.827
I'm f-feeling hungry.

08:38.347 --> 08:39.007
Huh?

08:41.377 --> 08:41.997
Hmm?

08:43.487 --> 08:45.437
You're hungry too, huh?

08:45.437 --> 08:46.467
Yeah!

08:46.467 --> 08:50.227
Lady Lufas, there's a nice 
smell coming from over there.

08:52.787 --> 08:56.347
Then we'll get some food while we
wait for Libra to finish her search.

08:56.347 --> 08:57.477
Yay!

08:57.477 --> 08:58.737
Let's go!

09:00.347 --> 09:01.567
Huh?

09:07.547 --> 09:09.037
Hello!

09:09.037 --> 09:10.997
It smells really good.

09:10.997 --> 09:12.187
Right?!

09:12.187 --> 09:13.457
Hmm?

09:13.847 --> 09:15.417
Welcome!

09:15.967 --> 09:18.377
We would like to order a meal.

09:20.267 --> 09:21.497
<i>What's this?</i>

09:21.497 --> 09:23.587
<i>He looks competent.</i>

09:24.317 --> 09:24.797
Hmm?

09:25.107 --> 09:27.137
<i>He seems to be acting strange?</i>

09:28.267 --> 09:30.367
Oh! I was surprised!

09:34.317 --> 09:35.937
H-Hey...

09:38.687 --> 09:40.307
I have longed...

09:40.307 --> 09:42.867
<i>longed</i> for this day to come for so long!

09:44.077 --> 09:45.407
<i>I take back what I thought!</i>

09:45.407 --> 09:48.987
<i>He's a bad type of man: 
he's a complete moron!</i>

09:49.357 --> 09:51.797
Ever since we lost you,

09:51.797 --> 09:53.897
I haven't forgotten the 
regret that pained me then!

09:53.897 --> 09:55.017
I haven't been able to sleep,

09:55.017 --> 09:55.787
though I do nap.

09:55.787 --> 09:57.217
I haven't been able to eat a proper meal,

09:57.217 --> 09:58.207
though I do snack.

09:58.207 --> 09:59.717
I took it easy—no, no,

09:59.717 --> 10:01.907
I <i>anguished</i>, hoping you would
return to us one day!

10:01.907 --> 10:04.507
So I've waited and waited 
and <i>waited</i> all this time!

10:04.507 --> 10:06.517
I believed

10:06.517 --> 10:08.637
in you!

10:09.007 --> 10:11.967
<i>Could this guy be?</i>

10:12.687 --> 10:15.187
I knew that wouldn't 
be enough to finish you!

10:15.187 --> 10:17.217
I'm so glad you were able to return to us!

10:17.217 --> 10:19.017
My beloved master!

10:19.017 --> 10:23.607
Reaching your hand around Master's 
waist without consent is rude!

10:25.447 --> 10:26.567
Oh?

10:26.567 --> 10:27.727
My goodness.

10:27.727 --> 10:29.657
You're here too, Libra?

10:30.177 --> 10:33.117
If I were anyone else,
that would have killed me.

10:33.117 --> 10:36.747
I see your sturdiness and 
frivolity are the same as ever.

10:36.747 --> 10:38.607
Yoohoo! Long time no see!

10:38.607 --> 10:40.257
Oops! I'm sorry.

10:40.257 --> 10:41.547
So you truly are

10:41.807 --> 10:43.127
Karkinos?

10:43.397 --> 10:46.007
<b>The Conquering Twelve Heavenly Star</b>

10:43.397 --> 10:46.007
<b>Karkinos the Crab</b>

10:46.397 --> 10:50.367
Please, have some of my 
specially made crab soup!

10:50.367 --> 10:52.657
How did you get crab in this nation?

10:52.657 --> 10:54.307
It looks good!

10:54.307 --> 10:56.117
So, Karkinos?

10:56.117 --> 10:58.767
Why have you opened a restaurant here?

10:58.767 --> 11:00.907
I'm so glad you asked!

11:00.907 --> 11:03.107
After you were defeated, Lady Lufas,

11:03.107 --> 11:04.907
I believed that you 
would one day resurrect,

11:04.907 --> 11:06.917
so I traveled between nations

11:06.917 --> 11:08.917
seeking information.

11:08.917 --> 11:09.757
It's good!

11:08.917 --> 11:09.757
<i>It's good!</i>

11:09.757 --> 11:10.287
<i>Wait...</i>

11:10.287 --> 11:12.797
<i>Is he using himself to make the broth?!</i>

11:12.797 --> 11:13.697
However, I realized

11:14.107 --> 11:17.667
it would be better to create a place 
where information comes to me!

11:17.667 --> 11:19.547
So you chose a restaurant?

11:19.547 --> 11:20.587
That's right!

11:20.587 --> 11:23.557
I opened up shop here and 
gathered information!

11:24.367 --> 11:26.217
This is Barometz!

11:26.217 --> 11:27.087
Hey!

11:26.217 --> 11:30.177
<b>Barometz</b>

11:26.217 --> 11:30.177
<b>A Plant That Grows Sheep As Its Fruit/Tastes Like Crab When Eaten</b>

11:27.087 --> 11:30.177
Quit pretending it's crab and 
scamming people!

11:31.367 --> 11:34.517
Unbelievable!

11:34.827 --> 11:38.477
So, now we ourselves have come 
to visit this restaurant.

11:38.477 --> 11:39.997
Oh, yes!

11:39.997 --> 11:41.937
This is truly destiny at work!

11:42.287 --> 11:43.917
I knew that we were bound by

11:43.917 --> 11:46.517
a red thread of fate as master 
and servant, Lady Lufas!

11:46.517 --> 11:48.277
Release that hand.

11:48.817 --> 11:52.537
<i>His idea to open up a 
restaurant wasn't bad, but...</i>

11:52.537 --> 11:53.487
Well...

11:53.947 --> 11:56.707
You certainly picked 
the wrong location.

11:56.707 --> 12:00.497
You should have opened your
restaurant in the Trade City of Ydalir.

12:02.277 --> 12:05.377
Blutgang is a capital isolated 
from the rest of the world.

12:05.377 --> 12:08.787
The Trade City would have let you learn 
of Lady Lufas's resurrection sooner,

12:08.787 --> 12:10.587
so you could have reunited 
with her faster.

12:12.997 --> 12:14.307
I, too...

12:14.307 --> 12:16.997
was starting to realize that.

12:16.997 --> 12:18.787
It seemed as if this nation
wasn't getting much

12:18.787 --> 12:20.517
information about the outside world.

12:20.517 --> 12:22.347
Come on, you should have realized that.

12:22.347 --> 12:24.987
You're just as dumb as ever, Karkinos.

12:24.987 --> 12:26.317
I'm exasperated.

12:26.317 --> 12:27.377
I concur.

12:27.377 --> 12:28.987
Mister Crab...

12:30.607 --> 12:32.947
<i>Those were merciless follow-ups.</i>

12:33.397 --> 12:38.307
<i>That said, Karkinos has managed 
to integrate into human society</i>

12:38.307 --> 12:41.727
<i>and open up a restaurant despite it all.</i>

12:41.727 --> 12:44.237
<i>And he did it for Lufas's sake.</i>

12:44.237 --> 12:45.917
<i>Even if he is a little dumb.</i>

12:46.397 --> 12:47.787
Karkinos.

12:47.787 --> 12:51.047
We are traveling to retrieve 
the Twelve Heavenly Stars.

12:51.047 --> 12:52.777
You mark the fifth one.

12:53.137 --> 12:55.367
Will you come with us?

12:58.467 --> 13:01.707
I, Karkinos the Crab,
one of the Twelve Heavenly Stars,

13:02.107 --> 13:04.817
offer you my unwavering 
loyalty to you once more.

13:04.947 --> 13:06.777
<b>Twelve Heavenly Star Karkinos</b>

13:04.947 --> 13:06.777
m 0 -75 l 25 -75 25 85 0 85

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
<b>Level</b>

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
<b>Race</b>

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
<b>King Crab</b>

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
<b>Element</b>

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
<b>Earth</b>

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
m 0 -30 l 20 -30 20 30 0 30

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
m 0 -25 l 22 -25 22 25 0 25

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
m 0 -45 l 18 -45 18 45 0 45

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
m 0 -30 l 20 -30 20 15 0 15

13:05.117 --> 13:06.777
m 0 -15 l 18 -15 18 15 0 15

13:15.757 --> 13:17.237
<b>Karkinos Has Joined Your Party</b>

13:17.767 --> 13:20.607
Now, I have preparations to make!

13:20.607 --> 13:22.707
Will your restaurant be alright?

13:22.707 --> 13:24.367
That's no problem!

13:24.367 --> 13:27.467
It won't matter if I just open one 
again once everything is over!

13:27.467 --> 13:28.687
Barometz...

13:29.667 --> 13:30.547
What?!

13:30.547 --> 13:31.687
What are you doing?!

13:31.687 --> 13:33.037
I mean, come on!

13:32.047 --> 13:34.057
Umm, Lady Lufas...

13:33.037 --> 13:34.057
Give it back!

13:34.057 --> 13:36.137
He's my precious ingredient!

13:34.057 --> 13:36.147
Hmm? What is it?

13:36.387 --> 13:38.647
Ingredients! Ingredient, you say?!

13:36.387 --> 13:38.647
Oh, not fitting in?

13:38.647 --> 13:39.837
He's a good boy!

13:39.837 --> 13:40.797
I'm going to smoke him!

13:40.157 --> 13:43.707
Is it really all right for me to be here?

13:40.797 --> 13:42.827
Smoke?! Smoke it?!

13:42.827 --> 13:45.797
He'll turn out quite delicious.

13:43.707 --> 13:45.797
Everyone else is so incredible.

13:45.797 --> 13:47.477
Stop! Stop!

13:46.397 --> 13:48.957
Having someone low-level like me around...

13:48.957 --> 13:50.867
There's no need to fret.

13:50.867 --> 13:54.507
You are the one that Parthenos 
chose as her successor.

13:54.847 --> 13:58.077
You'll come to stand on 
par with them in no time.

13:58.077 --> 13:59.147
But...

13:59.907 --> 14:02.827
<i>This is an emergency 
announcement to all Blutgang!</i>

14:02.827 --> 14:05.917
<i>Blutgang will soon engage in combat 
with Scorpius the Scorpion,</i>

14:05.917 --> 14:08.637
<i>one of the Conquering 
Twelve Heavenly Stars!</i>

14:08.637 --> 14:09.497
<i>I say again!</i>

14:09.767 --> 14:11.937
<i>Blutgang will engage
Scorpius the Scorpion,</i>

14:11.937 --> 14:13.967
<i>one of the Conquering 
Twelve Heavenly Stars!</i>

14:16.867 --> 14:18.387
<i>The time has come.</i>

14:23.057 --> 14:25.057
I hate this.

14:25.057 --> 14:27.077
This capital has no style!

14:27.077 --> 14:29.307
It lacks elegance!

14:29.947 --> 14:31.507
Right?

14:31.507 --> 14:34.437
Don't you all think so too?

14:35.237 --> 14:36.127
But

14:36.127 --> 14:38.447
it makes the perfect prey for me!

14:38.447 --> 14:44.557
I imagine my poison will spread so fast 
within that small, confined space!

14:44.557 --> 14:47.107
Ahh, I can't wait!

14:47.107 --> 14:50.357
I wonder if they'll perish in despair?

14:53.337 --> 14:55.407
I can't get enough of this!

14:55.407 --> 14:57.547
The anticipation is making me wet!

15:00.257 --> 15:02.347
Distance to target, 600!

15:02.347 --> 15:03.907
No obstacles!

15:03.907 --> 15:05.047
Our target is in front of us!

15:05.047 --> 15:07.197
The countless monsters 
show no signs of movement!

15:07.197 --> 15:08.897
So you have come,

15:08.897 --> 15:09.897
you venomous bitch.

15:10.247 --> 15:13.567
<b>Blutgang's Supreme Commander</b>

15:10.247 --> 15:13.567
<b>Admiral Jenner</b>

15:11.757 --> 15:13.567
We'll strike first.

15:13.937 --> 15:15.357
Ready the cannons!

15:15.357 --> 15:16.817
Ready cannons!

15:20.237 --> 15:23.067
Now, all my cuties!

15:23.067 --> 15:25.647
It's time for you to board that 
big, stupid hunk of junk

15:25.647 --> 15:28.167
and let loose!

15:28.167 --> 15:31.167
After me!

15:31.627 --> 15:32.897
Target acquired!

15:32.897 --> 15:35.087
Adjusting angle of elevation, minus 0.3!

15:35.087 --> 15:37.057
Adjustment corrected!

15:37.057 --> 15:38.207
Target confirmed!

15:38.207 --> 15:40.897
Everyone, brace for impact!

15:41.387 --> 15:42.347
Fire!

15:47.357 --> 15:48.597
Hit confirmed!

15:48.597 --> 15:49.587
Did we get her?!

15:49.587 --> 15:50.457
Yep!

15:51.287 --> 15:53.147
I-It can't be!

15:53.687 --> 15:54.237
Huh?!

15:54.237 --> 15:54.807
What?!

15:54.807 --> 15:56.777
S-She's unscathed?!

15:57.057 --> 15:59.717
Ready the second volley!

15:59.717 --> 16:00.317
Yes, sir!

16:00.317 --> 16:01.627
Target remains stationary!

16:01.627 --> 16:02.827
Target locked!

16:02.827 --> 16:04.287
Cannons ready to fire!

16:04.647 --> 16:05.747
Fire!

16:13.587 --> 16:15.237
W-Well?

16:16.047 --> 16:16.977
No good!

16:16.977 --> 16:18.497
They're ineffective against Scorpius!

16:18.497 --> 16:19.917
No matter how many we fire!

16:19.917 --> 16:23.287
However, we have thinned the 
numbers surrounding her.

16:23.287 --> 16:25.067
Is our golem squad ready yet?!

16:25.067 --> 16:26.677
Finished now!

16:26.677 --> 16:28.197
Initiate deployment.

16:28.197 --> 16:28.637
Yes, sir!

16:36.407 --> 16:37.567
Oh my?

16:38.107 --> 16:40.067
Charge!

16:40.417 --> 16:42.587
Intercept them!

16:53.537 --> 16:55.457
Main cannon, prepare to fire!

16:55.457 --> 16:56.387
Huh?!

16:56.387 --> 16:59.557
But then we'll catch our 
allied golems in the blast!

16:59.557 --> 17:00.417
I don't care!

17:00.417 --> 17:02.427
We can rebuild the golems!

17:02.427 --> 17:04.507
That woman uses poison!

17:04.507 --> 17:07.767
We have to settle this 
before she gets too close!

17:07.767 --> 17:08.677
Roger!

17:08.677 --> 17:10.647
Main cannon, preparing to fire!

17:10.647 --> 17:12.147
Confirming the blast area for the cannon!

17:12.147 --> 17:13.917
Energy's still charging!

17:13.917 --> 17:15.357
Pressure rising!

17:15.607 --> 17:17.197
Aim set!

17:17.197 --> 17:19.317
Enemy at 600, allies at 100!

17:19.317 --> 17:21.787
Activate the main cannon!

17:21.787 --> 17:23.277
Activating main cannon!

17:23.277 --> 17:26.237
Energy charge at 80%!

17:26.237 --> 17:29.197
Solution on target, weapon ready!

17:29.197 --> 17:30.597
90%!

17:30.597 --> 17:31.607
Main cannon!

17:31.607 --> 17:33.167
Charge complete!

17:33.167 --> 17:35.497
Fire!

17:38.507 --> 17:39.707
Whoa!

17:52.517 --> 17:53.307
Did we get her?!

17:53.307 --> 17:55.057
Roughly 600 enemies wiped out!

17:55.057 --> 17:56.357
Good!

17:56.357 --> 17:59.987
We have a chance to win this 
with our honed strategies!

18:01.387 --> 18:05.257
My, oh my, hitting your 
allies too? Naughty boy.

18:06.807 --> 18:08.137
In that case,

18:08.137 --> 18:12.407
perhaps I'll have a little fun too!

18:21.037 --> 18:21.777
Admiral!

18:21.777 --> 18:23.677
We've lost communication with
some of our golems!

18:23.677 --> 18:24.507
What?!

18:24.757 --> 18:27.927
A-At this rate, they'll all be wiped out!

18:29.117 --> 18:30.447
Damn monster!

18:30.887 --> 18:32.407
No choice!

18:32.407 --> 18:34.297
Send in the Scales Corps!

18:34.297 --> 18:36.987
That's the only thing that 
can hope to combat her.

18:36.987 --> 18:38.507
R-Roger!

18:38.867 --> 18:40.107
Bad news!

18:40.607 --> 18:42.497
Multiple large mana
signatures coming from

18:42.497 --> 18:44.167
the first district of Blutgang!

18:44.167 --> 18:46.067
Devilfolk are pouring in!

18:46.677 --> 18:48.027
What?!

18:52.267 --> 18:54.167
Things are getting loud.

18:54.167 --> 18:54.957
Yes.

18:54.957 --> 18:58.167
Those guys just pop up everywhere.

18:58.167 --> 19:03.127
This is to be expected since we knew
Scorpius colluded with the devilfolk.

19:03.127 --> 19:05.687
This moon element mana...

19:05.687 --> 19:06.767
Luna, huh?

19:06.767 --> 19:07.587
Luna?

19:07.927 --> 19:09.847
A devilfolk who commands 
the power of the moon.

19:09.847 --> 19:11.647
She's one of the Seven Luminaries.

19:11.647 --> 19:14.557
She mainly specializes in 
assassinations and sowing confusion.

19:14.877 --> 19:16.527
<i>If she's a skilled assassin,</i>

19:16.527 --> 19:19.377
<i>then that's far more troublesome 
than the other Seven Luminaries.</i>

19:19.377 --> 19:22.027
<i>But why would she get involved 
in such an obvious assault?</i>

19:22.027 --> 19:23.317
Aigokeros,

19:23.317 --> 19:26.807
if you can pinpoint her mana, 
then you know where she is, yes?

19:26.807 --> 19:28.497
Easily done.

19:28.497 --> 19:29.417
Good.

19:29.417 --> 19:31.607
Then you shall pursue this Luna.

19:31.607 --> 19:33.487
Capture her alive, if possible.

19:33.797 --> 19:36.957
However, do not catch residents
in the crossfire.

19:37.557 --> 19:38.667
As you command.

19:38.947 --> 19:42.637
Aries and Libra, clear out the 
remaining devilfolk inside the city.

19:42.637 --> 19:43.627
Yes!

19:42.637 --> 19:43.627
Understood.

19:43.967 --> 19:45.137
<i>Virgo...</i>

19:45.137 --> 19:48.447
<i>should farm some levels against 
the monster horde, I suppose.</i>

19:48.847 --> 19:52.097
Dina, Karkinos, Virgo, come with us!

19:52.467 --> 19:54.207
We're going to stop Scorpius!

19:54.207 --> 19:54.927
Yes!

19:54.927 --> 19:56.307
Y-Yes!

19:57.887 --> 19:59.267
Huh?

19:59.687 --> 20:01.287
What's that?

20:02.657 --> 20:04.147
If it isn't Libra!

20:04.687 --> 20:07.647
We're counting on you, Scales Corps!

20:08.167 --> 20:09.907
Target acquired.

20:09.907 --> 20:13.447
I shall now defeat one of the
Conquering Twelve Heavenly Stars...

20:15.027 --> 20:16.327
Scorpius the Scorpion.

20:16.327 --> 20:18.407
Zuben El Genubi.

20:20.747 --> 20:22.747
Zuben Es Chamali.

20:24.567 --> 20:25.417
Tsk!

20:25.417 --> 20:27.247
Enemy lightly wounded.

20:27.247 --> 20:29.377
No change in combat ability.

20:29.657 --> 20:31.337
Continuing attack.

20:31.337 --> 20:33.327
Now I understand.

20:34.097 --> 20:38.307
You girls must be replicas of the 
Libra that Mizar made, right?

20:42.357 --> 20:44.257
<i>Still, that's strange.</i>

20:44.257 --> 20:48.317
<i>At the last moment, the original 
would have fired Brachium.</i>

20:48.317 --> 20:49.917
<i>How odd.</i>

20:49.917 --> 20:53.407
<i>I wonder why you didn't fire it when 
you had the perfect opportunity to?</i>

20:54.707 --> 20:58.117
<i>Oh, it's because you 
don't have it, isn't it?</i>

20:58.117 --> 21:01.827
<i>You all are missing your 
most important armament!</i>

21:04.787 --> 21:06.687
<i>What silly fools!</i>

21:06.687 --> 21:08.787
<i>A Libra without Brachium</i>

21:08.787 --> 21:12.607
<i>is hardly a match for my pincers!</i>

21:18.987 --> 21:20.517
Hmm?

21:20.517 --> 21:23.397
Not only are you unequipped with Brachium,

21:23.397 --> 21:27.567
you also only came equipped with one 
half of the Scales, didn't you?!

21:33.947 --> 21:35.407
Dummies!

21:35.407 --> 21:38.287
Did you think you could escape me?!

21:38.617 --> 21:42.917
If you all are replicas of Libra, 
then your element is metal.

21:42.917 --> 21:48.167
My fire element melts metal, 
so there's no way I'll lose!

21:56.047 --> 22:00.007
Self-destruct sequence...

22:00.217 --> 22:02.107
initiated.

22:13.167 --> 22:15.817
<b>Translator:
John Pickett

Timer:
Andy Ellis

Editor:
Gabriella Alabanza

Quality Control:
Salem Alabanza</b>
